ence","tenderTechnicalCriterionDocumentList":[{"documentName":"Work Done Certificate"}]},{"description":"Regarding the service experience of the tenderer, the work order and experience certificates obtained from the concerned department regarding the supply of food and other items notified in the tender for not less than Rs. 300/- lakhs in the three financial years from preceding the financial year of tender inviting (2023-24, 2024-25 and 2025-26) should be filled in the prescribed form and submitted. To be submitted in Annexure-03","criterionCategoryText":"Past Experience","tenderTechnicalCriterionDocumentList":[{"documentName":"Others -- Relevant Document"}]},{"description":"Technical Documents Application Form (Submission of the prescribed tender form filled in with complete information of the name, address and mobile number of the tenderer along with the seal of the company)","criterionCategoryText":"Capabilities of Vendor","tenderTechnicalCriterionDocumentList":[{"documentName":"Others -- Relevant Document"}]},{"description":"Submission of application fee and EMD amount through e-portal.","criterionCategoryText":"Capabilities of Vendor","tenderTechnicalCriterionDocumentList":[{"documentName":"Others -- Relevant Document"}]},{"description":"If the agency is a firm, company, partnership or non-governmental organization, it should be registered under the relevant law. Necessary documents should be submitted in this regard. (Not applicable to sole proprietorship firms)","criterionCategoryText":"Capabilities of Vendor","tenderTechnicalCriterionDocumentList":[{"documentName":"Others -- Relevant Document"}]},{"description":"PAN number of the firm, if the firm is a private firm, a copy of the PAN number of the owner should be submitted.","criterionCategoryText":"Capabilities of Vendor","tenderTechnicalCriterionDocumentList":[{"documentName":"Others -- Relevant Document"}]},{"description":"Business license obtained from the Kolar Municipal Council/Purasabhe/Grama Pancha